      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently praise Dr. Griggs, the veterinary assistants, and front desk personnel for their kindness and deep veterinary knowledge. Long-time clients appreciate that staff members remember pets by name and treat each visit with genuine empathy. Pet parents describe the team as welcoming and dependable."
      }
    },
