      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle attention for family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently observe that their dogs and cats feel relaxed and comfortable throughout examinations and medical treatments. Many reviewers mention that senior pets and timid animals receive patient, stress-free handling from the veterinary staff. Owners note that pets often enter the clinic without fear."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
