      "title": {
        "en": "Accommodating scheduling and urgent visits"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple pet parents highlight the clinic's ability to fit pets in quickly for unexpected illnesses or time-sensitive procedures. Reviewers appreciate that the team accommodated same-day walk-in emergencies and offered flexible appointment times. Most visitors describe short waiting times before entering exam rooms."
      }
    }
